      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "7 months ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "Everything I ordered tasted amazing — the nachos, fried rice, and buttermilk chicken were all really good ✨\n\nThe palm sugar coffee was delicious as well.\n\nIt’s a cozy spot and perfect for relaxing, getting some chitchat with bestie and getting some work from cafe..\nAnd the services all good..",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
