    {
      "name": "places/ChIJa9-Yc-rzaS4Rj6EivhLIGTs/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25aMVRXczVaVzFsVFdScVFVTXpUMGRxT0VGeWMyYxAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "11 months ago",
      "rating": 3,
      "text": {
        "text": "Sorry I had to give 3 stars — the missing 2 are mainly for cleanliness. There were some spots on the sofa, table, and even in the musholla, plus the bin wasn’t in great shape. Also, there were no tissues on the table — I had to keep getting them from the counter, which was kinda funny 😅 Maybe you have your own reasons, but it’d be nice to have a small box on each table.\n\nOther than that, the food was great and the portions were just right 👌",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
