    {
      "name": "places/ChIJa9-Yc-rzaS4Rj6EivhLIGTs/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNYcEozeWp3RRAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "2 years ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "If you're a coffee lover in East Jakarta, you won't want to miss Mecto.\n\nThis cozy spot offers a variety of delicious coffee drinks, as well as a selection of pastries and main course.\nThe atmosphere is warm and inviting, with both indoor and outdoor seating areas.\nThe decor is stylish and modern, and the music is just right for a relaxing afternoon or evening.\nThere is also plenty of parking available, making it easy to get to and from the shop.\n\nWhether you're meeting up with friends for coffee or simply enjoying a cup on your own, Mecto is a great place to relax and unwind.",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
        "text": "If you're a coffee lover in East Jakarta, you won't want to miss Mecto.\n\nThis cozy spot offers a variety of delicious coffee drinks, as well as a selection of pastries and main course.\nThe atmosphere is warm and inviting, with both indoor and outdoor seating areas.\nThe decor is stylish and modern, and the music is just right for a relaxing afternoon or evening.\nThere is also plenty of parking available, making it easy to get to and from the shop.\n\nWhether you're meeting up with friends for coffee or simply enjoying a cup on your own, Mecto is a great place to relax and unwind.",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
